{
  "slug": "ui-kit",
  "name": "Ui Kit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "147 zero-dependency React components with Aurora Fluid design. 5 skills for component discovery, code generation, design   \n  system reference, tier selection, and accessibility auditing. 2 agents for architecture and a11y review. Auto-connects to hosted MCP  server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 agents**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `audit-accessibility` (Audit React components for accessibility compliance with UI Kit conventions), `component-finder` (Find UI Kit components by name, feature, or use case), `design-system` (Explains the Aurora Fluid design system — OKLCH colors, physics animations, motion levels, weight tiers, CSS architecture, and…), `generate-component` (Generate production-ready React code using UI Kit components), `tier-guide` (Helps choose the right weight tier (Lite/Standard/Premium) based on project requirements)\n- **Agents** (2): `accessibility-reviewer` (Reviews code for accessibility compliance with UI Kit conventions), `component-architect` (Designs component compositions and page layouts using UI Kit)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `ui-kit-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ui-kit@claude-community` from `annondeveloper/ui-kit` (`plugins/claude-code`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "agent": 2,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
